rights.body:
You can at any time:

- see and download your data: Account page, "Your data", "Download my data" (a JSON file; each Room's export holds the campaign content you can see);
- correct your profile on the Account page;
- delete your account: Account page, "Your data", "Delete account";
- object to the processing or ask for its restriction, by writing to {{email}}.

You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority; in Italy this is the Garante per la protezione dei dati personali (garanteprivacy.it).
